        <mxCell id="c103" value="&lt;i&gt;No measured difference reaches half of its break-even: the largest share is 48%, promotion 2 (Accessories). A break-even is the lift the promotion needs, not a forecast of what it will bring; the gray track runs from zero to it.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="454" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
